    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6fb99449df33c51d0186c13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千金难买早知道。我一边惋惜着原本有可能与赛马娘\n共同度过的灿烂时光，一边缓缓闭上双眼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6478d1a5cc88c1b69fa7fb0aa7bd71157b5d92c273036d62f2db2c2e4b6e93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
