      "source_text": "不过，当我跟来签约的人这么说的时候，\n他们都说“无法理解”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bf61dbb6516e731aa33c2d624e35b1d30ad7d11cdf2b0c1dbb2b35a03c9b8fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
