    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf81bb437112e9db090d860",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她今后的发展令人在意）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1080fba9737e1eb4660ba00c3b75e55323e0aa896d044b22ed1937a57d6cd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cdd33f22df2e21d354007ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "味噌汤就不用了──但她奔跑时豪迈的身影确实令我印象深刻，\n那不可思议的气质也莫名地吸引我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c7c170a1a673c09ff8cf0e41f9c4af4ae7c5fc8c0530360e6bb94f6a473b06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b647cd595a2da024d3227c92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "脑中闪过这想法后，我点头答应了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f3576940e637bd523ee68e914a6aab5a65cb8f144ac439366037a4a8eae2f94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
