      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eef59870bc765dd410305fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱曙",
      "source_fingerprint": "74ec598a7a59e8ab3c03eddc51a564135cafc6d72200153668de53d40be0ba69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0eda3979d1f714cbf1e20f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对了，做为纪念，今天晚餐就煮你喜欢的东西吧～！\n你想吃什么？你想吃什么～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "63266084b54c68cfa67ba20e0d074f8e0c376bd6c17d13c69ee7226a5e3b0ae4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd35c0fb49b88269dacc003b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不由自主地把爱吃的东西告诉了雀跃不已的她……\n就这样，我与菱曙两人三脚的日子突然拉开了序幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85797960051fc98b332f56bdda6c7154ce2bb1d43b134ef139b1ce4b32c2aa68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd36d158e5c09889db0eebb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "忽然，我听见了某人的声音。虽然不清楚究竟是谁――\n却是令人感到很温暖的温柔嗓音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dbeeb61363a4ea763f7d36a9526bbe7cfe6c4e67d5a9e9dc13604a6d6aef927",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dcaf525dd784f43df52fb9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "？？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe3a9d5ff5031b4a1a9f594cb565c8f7ef7186527690676d3e3ef2f40304c71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d13b201f259c42cdfece060",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道发生什么事，但看来你吃了很多苦呢～\n已经没事咯～来，请喝水☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41da00dc235fabf8b9fc5aaa80adcd156ac9915b27b6021317db8b99ed2b1e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3564b1093dfe13145b5d424a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（女神……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "a765541996317ffd35fdf77f67c680d3f9faee0c321700910d99d8dcdcce801a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53542f7c23a81166aa8f14d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对方扶起我的身体，把杯子凑近我的嘴边。我能直觉地感受到，\n一具包容万物的巨大身驱所给予我的安心感。她一定是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "913423061e0a35f445edfebcd6f43e09a079df3d6e7acd2cb8ebdf52ceb25548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef41c923992cf0fa1661974",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喝完水后，她又给了我温热的味噌汤。\n我埋头享用着那碗汤，模糊的意识也逐渐清醒――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6501b3b827763fa50047ba10aa5c858b4b5913211596651ca7acfd8bd1390f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e795054b387c02735335c301",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "定睛一看，那位“女神”原来是菱曙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69deb84452a123eb5a64f44b9156a543c26359f49a8da06e48e5c47eabccd986",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59c062692a17f03e6724759e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巨大的女神",
      "source_fingerprint": "4565c2d74aae760227aa564716e6b951267e85ec30165cbc528ed1a24405a0a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1028/storytimeline_041028001.json",
      "json_path": [
